      "THE LANGUAGE HAD NO BLOCKING LAYER AND NINE APPS EACH HAD ONE, which is the only gap in this system where the adopters were not re-composing parts but inventing an interaction. A message, something to look at while it works, and a way out — written nine times, nine ways. Grepping for “modal”, “overlay” and “toast” returned nothing at all, and a language exists to settle exactly that kind of thing once.",
