      "THE DESK GOES DARK AND STAYS THE DESK. The cover is `--room` thickened, not a blur and not a wash of black: the grain, the lamp and whatever panel you were working on are all still there and dimmer, which is what says the modal is ON the desk rather than a new page. A blur would be the one effect on this site that no machined object can make. z-index 500 — the number `.win.maxed` already named, its own comment saying anything a host means to keep reachable from 400 sits above it by its own.",
