      "A SECOND DRESS FOR THE SELECTOR — dress:'deck'. The plain one is a good piece of software: a window with the name in it, and a plate that appears. This one is a PART, and the difference is the mechanism — the list does not appear, it SWINGS OUT. A legend card hinged along the edge it came from, falling open about its own top edge under a real perspective. Not a flourish borrowed from somewhere: a hinged legend card is what a patchbay, an aircraft checklist and a tape machine mode plate all actually are.",
